<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica Reserve Bank in routine meeting with banks.</title>
<headline>SAfrica Reserve Bank in routine meeting with banks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African Reserve Bank officials were holding a routine meeting with the Council of Southern African Bankers on Wednesday, a central bank spokesman said.</p>
<p>He said the bi-annual meeting would discuss, among other things, the recent relaxation of foreign exchange controls.</p>
<p>&quot;It is a periodic meeting to discuss various issues. Foreign exchange controls will be amongst the issues discussed,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>He said the bank did not plan to release a statement after the meeting.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
